<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 5px; }
        .header { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #28a745; }
        .details { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 30px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">Your Support Request Has Been Resolved</div>
        <div class="details">
            <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
            <p>We are pleased to inform you that your support ticket <strong>#<%= ticketId %></strong> has been marked as resolved.</p>
            <p><strong>Resolution Date:</strong> <%= date %></p>
            <p>If you have further questions or if the issue persists, please feel free to open a new ticket or contact us directly.</p>
            <p>Thank you for your patience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            Best regards,<br>
            The Mercury 10000 Support Team
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
